From 200b6b502d26bfcf72215ce403f7821561a311ba Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Sun, 15 Nov 2026 03:53:26 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 2/4] prf-long checkpoint 2: D3 (the query-chain machine at
 answer width l(n))

D3 (Encryption/PrivateKey/FromPRF/ReductionMachine.lean): the string layer at answer width l
(histBlockOut, maskBlockOut, maskOfOut, postCountOut/postOffsetOut/postQueryOut/postFunOut,
adviceBoundOut and their lemmas), exists_queryChainOut_nuppt and its one-query case
exists_oneQuery_nuppt. The n-bit string-layer lemmas and exists_queryChain_nuppt are re-derived
through rfl bridges as the case l = var. No frozen header or definition changes.
---
 .../PrivateKey/FromPRF/ReductionMachine.lean  | 529 ++++++++++++++----
 1 file changed, 417 insertions(+), 112 deletions(-)

diff --git a/TCSlib/Cryptography/Encryption/PrivateKey/FromPRF/ReductionMachine.lean b/TCSlib/Cryptography/Encryption/PrivateKey/FromPRF/ReductionMachine.lean
index 11f31f81a..99facd0f6 100644
